---
import { Table } from "@opui/astro"
---

<h3 id="toggle-button-svelte">Toggle Button</h3>

<Table>
  <Table.ColumnGroup>
    <Table.Column width="min-width: 20%" />
    <Table.Column width="min-width: 20%" />
    <Table.Column width="min-width: 20%" />
    <Table.Column width="min-width: 300px" />
  </Table.ColumnGroup>
  <Table.Head>
    <Table.Row>
      <Table.HeaderCell>Prop</Table.HeaderCell>
      <Table.HeaderCell>Type</Table.HeaderCell>
      <Table.HeaderCell>Default</Table.HeaderCell>
      <Table.HeaderCell>Description</Table.HeaderCell>
    </Table.Row>
  </Table.Head>
  <Table.Body>
    <Table.Row>
      <Table.Cell>Snippets</Table.Cell>
      <Table.Cell><code>children</code></Table.Cell>
      <Table.Cell>-</Table.Cell>
      <Table.Cell>Optional snippets.</Table.Cell>
    </Table.Row>
    <Table.Row>
      <Table.Cell><code>disabled</code></Table.Cell>
      <Table.Cell><code>boolean</code></Table.Cell>
      <Table.Cell>-</Table.Cell>
      <Table.Cell>Whether the toggle button is disabled.</Table.Cell>
    </Table.Row>
    <Table.Row>
      <Table.Cell><code>label</code></Table.Cell>
      <Table.Cell><code>string</code></Table.Cell>
      <Table.Cell>-</Table.Cell>
      <Table.Cell
        >Fallback for <code>value</code>. Not rendered; use <code>children</code
        > for visible content.</Table.Cell
      >
    </Table.Row>
    <Table.Row>
      <Table.Cell><code>name</code></Table.Cell>
      <Table.Cell><code>string</code></Table.Cell>
      <Table.Cell>-</Table.Cell>
      <Table.Cell
        >The name of the input element. Inherited from ToggleGroup if used
        within one.</Table.Cell
      >
    </Table.Row>
    <Table.Row>
      <Table.Cell><code>pressed</code></Table.Cell>
      <Table.Cell><code>boolean</code></Table.Cell>
      <Table.Cell>-</Table.Cell>
      <Table.Cell
        >Whether the toggle button is pressed. Maps to <code>aria-pressed</code> in
        checkbox mode and to <code>checked</code> on the underlying input.</Table.Cell
      >
    </Table.Row>
    <Table.Row>
      <Table.Cell><code>size</code></Table.Cell>
      <Table.Cell><code>"small"</code>, <code>"x-small"</code></Table.Cell>
      <Table.Cell>-</Table.Cell>
      <Table.Cell>The size of the toggle button.</Table.Cell>
    </Table.Row>
    <Table.Row>
      <Table.Cell><code>type</code></Table.Cell>
      <Table.Cell><code>"checkbox"</code>, <code>"radio"</code></Table.Cell>
      <Table.Cell><code>"checkbox"</code></Table.Cell>
      <Table.Cell
        >The type of input element. Inherited from ToggleGroup (driven by the <code
          >selection</code
        > prop) if used within one.</Table.Cell
      >
    </Table.Row>
    <Table.Row>
      <Table.Cell><code>value</code></Table.Cell>
      <Table.Cell><code>string</code></Table.Cell>
      <Table.Cell>-</Table.Cell>
      <Table.Cell
        >The value attribute of the input element. Defaults to <code>label</code
        > if not provided.</Table.Cell
      >
    </Table.Row>
  </Table.Body>
</Table>

<h3 id="toggle-group-svelte">Toggle Group</h3>

<Table>
  <Table.ColumnGroup>
    <Table.Column width="min-width: 20%" />
    <Table.Column width="min-width: 20%" />
    <Table.Column width="min-width: 20%" />
    <Table.Column width="min-width: 300px" />
  </Table.ColumnGroup>
  <Table.Head>
    <Table.Row>
      <Table.HeaderCell>Prop</Table.HeaderCell>
      <Table.HeaderCell>Type</Table.HeaderCell>
      <Table.HeaderCell>Default</Table.HeaderCell>
      <Table.HeaderCell>Description</Table.HeaderCell>
    </Table.Row>
  </Table.Head>
  <Table.Body>
    <Table.Row>
      <Table.Cell>Snippets</Table.Cell>
      <Table.Cell><code>children</code></Table.Cell>
      <Table.Cell>-</Table.Cell>
      <Table.Cell>Optional snippets.</Table.Cell>
    </Table.Row>
    <Table.Row>
      <Table.Cell><code>name</code></Table.Cell>
      <Table.Cell><code>string</code></Table.Cell>
      <Table.Cell>-</Table.Cell>
      <Table.Cell
        >The name property for child inputs. Used for native form submission.</Table.Cell
      >
    </Table.Row>
    <Table.Row>
      <Table.Cell><code>orientation</code></Table.Cell>
      <Table.Cell><code>"vertical"</code></Table.Cell>
      <Table.Cell>-</Table.Cell>
      <Table.Cell>Changes the layout direction of the group.</Table.Cell>
    </Table.Row>
    <Table.Row>
      <Table.Cell><code>selection</code></Table.Cell>
      <Table.Cell><code>"single"</code>, <code>"multiple"</code></Table.Cell>
      <Table.Cell><code>"multiple"</code></Table.Cell>
      <Table.Cell
        >The selection mode. <code>"single"</code> maps to radio inputs; <code
          >"multiple"</code
        > maps to checkbox inputs.</Table.Cell
      >
    </Table.Row>
    <Table.Row>
      <Table.Cell><code>size</code></Table.Cell>
      <Table.Cell
        ><code>"default"</code>, <code>"small"</code>, <code>"x-small"</code
        ></Table.Cell
      >
      <Table.Cell><code>"default"</code></Table.Cell>
      <Table.Cell>The size of the toggle group.</Table.Cell>
    </Table.Row>
  </Table.Body>
</Table>
